---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms" description="Draft terms information for Aidan Brotherhood." noindex={true}>
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="prose prose-lg surface-card p-5 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
      <h1>Terms</h1>
      <p>
        These are draft terms for private review. The site provides general information about coaching services,
        training, nutrition habits, and physical capability.
      </p>
      <h2>General information only</h2>
      <p>
        Posts and service pages are educational and informational. They are not medical advice, diagnosis, treatment,
        or a substitute for working with an appropriate healthcare professional where needed.
      </p>
      <h2>Coaching enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        Submitting an enquiry does not guarantee coaching availability or acceptance as a client. If coaching looks
        appropriate, any consultation, screening, onboarding, pricing, and service terms can be confirmed separately.
      </p>
      <h2>Before public launch</h2>
      <p>
        These terms should be reviewed and finalised before public launch, commercial booking, payments, or a formal
        client onboarding process.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
